                    "file": "docs/guide/unit-testing/readme.md",
                    "line": 168,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nikhil Ashoka",
                        "email": "a.nikhil@ibm.com",
                        "username": "Nikhil-Ashoka"
                    },
                    "message": "The changes looks good. However, In unit-testing/readme.md, We have a warning for Pros and Cons as `MD024/no-duplicate-heading: Multiple headings with the same content`"
                },
                {
                    "file": "docs/guide/unit-testing/readme.md",
                    "line": 168,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "That is not reported by the markdownlint directives ran in CI:\n\n```\n    Running eslint\n    Running markdownlint\n    Running prettier\n```\n\nI'm only interested in getting CI to pass so that we can turn on markdownlint across the entire repository.  If you see other markdownlint warnings in a different environment, we should probably figure out where that discrepancy is coming from."
                },
                {
                    "file": "docs/guide/unit-testing/readme.md",
                    "line": 168,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "This is because the org-wide markdownlint uses this additional config:\n\n```\nMD024:\n    siblings_only: true\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "docs/guide/unit-testing/readme.md",
                    "line": 168,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nikhil Ashoka",
                        "email": "a.nikhil@ibm.com",
                        "username": "Nikhil-Ashoka"
                    },
                    "message": "Right, Did not find this warning listed in the CI. I added the extension `markdownlint` (https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=DavidAnson.vscode-markdownlint) in the VS code editor. There I found this warning for these two lines(Line 168 and 173)."
                },
                {
                    "file": "docs/guide/unit-testing/readme.md",
                    "line": 168,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nikhil Ashoka",
                        "email": "a.nikhil@ibm.com",
                        "username": "Nikhil-Ashoka"
                    },
                    "message": "Right, There are no issues in the CI. I installed `markdownlint` in Visual Studio(https://github.com/DavidAnson/vscode-markdownlint?tab=readme-ov-file#install) and found these warnings in these two lines(Line 168 and 173). \n\n(https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc-build-scripts/blob/c675d088fb90bdfb04fa77439c4339d6598399d2/config/markdownlint.yaml#L4) \nHowever, this line in config has disabled flagging duplicate headings if they are not under same section. Which is right. I am good with this change."
                },
